{"title":"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(Quick_Estimate)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (Quick Estimate)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5_(Approximation)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5 (Approximation)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_6_(Dimensional_Analysis)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6 (Dimensional Analysis)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_(Quick_and_Easy)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 (Quick and Easy)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Mike cycled <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> laps in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/1/4b14ef560acadba8244952e9a8d5481f494445dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$57$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes. Assume he cycled at a constant speed throughout. Approximately how many laps did he complete in the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/5/1051e7d41ec0b8bd688a872be17538413f4ee97b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/1/4f1490d05bbc679c9c4efd790f535bd326ff5e19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 5 \\qquad\\textbf{(B) } 7 \\qquad\\textbf{(C) } 9 \\qquad\\textbf{(D) } 11 \\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"373\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Mike's speed is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/7/cc7d9df8cbf947a7ee078d0473a14c0a7f596f90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{15}{57}=\\frac{5}{19}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"70\" height=\"38\" /> laps per minute.\n</p><p>In the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/5/1051e7d41ec0b8bd688a872be17538413f4ee97b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes, he completed approximately <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/0/b503bd302356c034ce7260fc9e18a626333ac12a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{19}\\cdot27\\approx\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot28=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } 7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"203\" height=\"38\" /> laps.\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Mike runs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> lap in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/b/50bb9ca393bc8bd2e4d2d9881db83b6896d578c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{57}{15}=\\frac{19}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"70\" height=\"38\" /> minutes. So, in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/5/1051e7d41ec0b8bd688a872be17538413f4ee97b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes, Mike ran about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/666b97ab642b519164fa24847eb4a61e333d2412.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{27}{\\frac{19}{5}} \\approx \\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"103\" height=\"45\" /> laps.\n</p><p>~MrThinker\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Mike's rate is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/3/02357c82cc38c7308d0a04ce97912d5a1782a45a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{15}{57}=\\frac{x}{27},\\]\" width=\"70\" height=\"38\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is the number of laps he can complete in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/5/1051e7d41ec0b8bd688a872be17538413f4ee97b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes. \nIf you cross multiply, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/9/e3935b1c87389b9e98edbfb618882574e334d25c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$57x = 405$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"82\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/7/317cbb2f75bcb8e1d932e8b87ac09964a1ec796f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{405}{57} \\approx \\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"147\" height=\"38\" />. \n</p><p>~Shiloh000\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4_.28Quick_Estimate.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(Quick_Estimate)\">Solution 4 (Quick Estimate)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (Quick Estimate)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/5/1051e7d41ec0b8bd688a872be17538413f4ee97b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes is a little bit less than half of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/1/4b14ef560acadba8244952e9a8d5481f494445dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$57$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes. Mike will therefore run a little bit less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/b/5abf1192539f6aa808d4725005c71f81f60b0a7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15/2=7.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"83\" height=\"18\" /> laps, which is about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/9/e798326b0dbcb1dcabde8ae852ea02a17c41e1b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />. \n</p><p>~UltimateDL\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_5_.28Approximation.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5_(Approximation)\">Solution 5 (Approximation)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5 (Approximation)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/1/4b14ef560acadba8244952e9a8d5481f494445dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$57$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes is almost equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hour. Running <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> laps in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hour is running approximately <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> lap every <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> minutes. This means that in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/5/1051e7d41ec0b8bd688a872be17538413f4ee97b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes, Mike will run approximately <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/6/1f6c51048d1b97194eec4b2b1c1411c94ff8b9d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{27}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" /> laps. This is very close to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/4/924639f8c054e86139a2c37ed647eeab6b76faa0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{28}{4} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"103\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_6_.28Dimensional_Analysis.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6_(Dimensional_Analysis)\">Solution 6 (Dimensional Analysis)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6 (Dimensional Analysis)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/0/eb09787c126a2019483ea8264cc2f65f81db4092.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{15 \\text{ laps}}{57 \\text{ minutes}} \\cdot 27 \\text{ minutes} = \\frac{135}{19} \\text{ laps} \\approx \\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }7} \\text{ laps}\\]\" width=\"379\" height=\"38\" />\n~Blosp\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_1_.28Quick_and_Easy.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_(Quick_and_Easy)\">Video Solution 1 (Quick and Easy)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 (Quick and Easy)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/tu4rE1nqY9g\">https://youtu.be/tu4rE1nqY9g</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Zkmy3zQRzaQ\">https://youtu.be/Zkmy3zQRzaQ</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3\">Video Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bKtyNh5hPWI\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bKtyNh5hPWI</a>\n</p><p>~Math4All999\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A\">2022 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 10 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 10 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018014332\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 269/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2320/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 154/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5686/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.794      1 -total\n 61.21%    7.831      1 Template:AMC10_box\n 37.75%    4.829      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:23256:|#|: